From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: JHoon <maintainer@lindex.invalid>
Date: Wed, 26 Aug 2026 22:21:56 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] scripts: add bounded GStreamer H.264 decode diagnostics

Add an opt-in developer diagnostic that compares software and VA-API H.264 decode with the same input. Keep plugin discovery in a task-owned transient registry, disable scanner forking without signalling the scanner, bound both pipelines, and classify the last visible EOS/frame boundary from retained logs. Cover invocation, cleanup, timeout, finish versus post-bus process-timeout classification, and run it from the public verification workflow.
